      "wiki_content": "Accelerated Evolution was the first album by The Devin Townsend Band, released on March 31, 2003. Thematically, this album is about relationships (which was also the working title) and musically it's more straightforward than Terria, similar to Biomech. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/The+Devin+Townsend+Band/Accelerated+Evolution\">Read more on Last.fm</a>. User-contributed text is available under the Creative Commons By-SA License; additional terms may apply.",
      "wiki_summary": "Accelerated Evolution was the first album by The Devin Townsend Band, released on March 31, 2003. Thematically, this album is about relationships (which was also the working title) and musically it's more straightforward than Terria, similar to Biomech. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/The+Devin+Townsend+Band/Accelerated+Evolution\">Read more on Last.fm</a>."
